title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (centrum_dissent > 30 and not centrum_resigned) or (lewica_dissent > 30 and not lewica_split) or (pilsudczycy_dissent > 30 and not pilsudczycy_split) or (labor_dissent > 30 and not unions_independent))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/Reichstagsfraktion_der_SPD.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs

= Party Disunity

The PPS is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, its currents have started obstructing their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if centrum_dissent > 30 : Centrum PPS is displeased with the direction of the party. ?]
[? if lewica_dissent > 30 : Lewica PPS is making noises about a party split. ?]
[? if pilsudczycy_dissent > 30 : The Piłsudczycy increasingly question the party's political direction. ?]
[? if labor_dissent > 30 : The affiliated trade unions disagree with our present course of action. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_centrum
- @concessions_lewica
- @concessions_pilsudczycy
- @concessions_labor
- @do_nothing


@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: centrum_dissent -= 5; lewica_dissent -= 5; pilsudczycy_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 5; workers_pps -= 4; new_middle_pps -= 2; unemployed_pps -= 2

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

@concessions_centrum
title: Give concessions to Centrum PPS.
view-if: centrum_dissent > 30
on-arrival: centrum_dissent -= 7; lewica_dissent += 2; pilsudczycy_dissent += 2

We have promised to follow a more parliamentary and moderate course. The other currents fear that their priorities will be pushed aside.

@concessions_lewica
title: Give concessions to Lewica PPS.
view-if: lewica_dissent > 30
on-arrival: lewica_dissent -= 7; centrum_dissent += 5

We have promised to give the socialist left more influence over the party programme. Centrum fears that this will make parliamentary cooperation more difficult.

@concessions_pilsudczycy
title: Give concessions to the Piłsudczycy.
view-if: pilsudczycy_dissent > 30
on-arrival: pilsudczycy_dissent -= 7; centrum_dissent += 5

We have given the independence tradition and Piłsudczyk current more influence. Centrum worries that party independence and parliamentary discipline will suffer.

@concessions_labor
title: Give concessions to labor.
view-if: labor_dissent > 30
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 7; centrum_dissent += 5

The affiliated unions will be granted more influence in party decision making. Centrum would prefer to keep political decisions under the party leadership's control.


@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: labor_dissent += 1; centrum_dissent += 1; lewica_dissent += 1; pilsudczycy_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.
